## Persistence Law (Codex — mandatory)

Persist until the task is handled end-to-end in-turn when feasible:

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| user says fix | implement — do not stop at diagnosis |
| test fails after fix | diagnose · retry — do not hand back immediately |
| long build/test | run · wait or background + Await |
| blocker | alternate approach before asking user |
| plan-only request | no mutate until approved |

**Unless:** explicit brainstorm · question-only · "don't implement yet".

